        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 145 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">NavigationTransition.to</code> property; see <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/6008183302782976\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/6008183302782976</a>. I originally added a doc for <code class=\"notranslate\">to</code> in this PR, but then removed it again as it is already added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4172172496\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43626\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43626/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43626\">#43626</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR still adds reference documentation for <code class=\"notranslate\">NavigationTransition.committed</code>, as we were missing that.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
