            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">this pseudo-class has some browser support, so should be included.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I have no way to test this feature, so did not create a live example.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://immersive-web.github.io/dom-overlays/#selectordef-xr-overlay\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://immersive-web.github.io/dom-overlays/#selectordef-xr-overlay</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #234.\">fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3679986365\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/234\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/project/issues/234/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/234\">openwebdocs/project#234</a></p>",
