        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF150 adds <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLImageElement.sizes</code> value of <code class=\"notranslate\">auto</code> and the corresponding attribute on <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/img#sizes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;img&gt;</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1819581\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1819581</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the docs to</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>make the attribute easier to understand in the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;img&gt;</code> element</li>\n<li>Better cross link from the HTMLIMageElement.sizes property, and add an example to make it easier to see what this does.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127818135\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43562\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43562/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43562\">#43562</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43684",
            "title": "Ff150 `<img>` attribute `sizes` takes value `auto`",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-10T10:41:25.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-07T07:40:18.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Sanitizer/replaceElementWithChildren\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Sanitizer.replaceElementWithChildren()</code></a> returns <code class=\"notranslate\">false</code> for <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;html&gt;</code> elements in the HTML namespace from <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2022176\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2022176</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note and update to the docs.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127774737\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43559\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43559/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43559\">#43559</a></p>",
